481
00:26:13,160 --> 00:26:14,720
We'll have new evidence soon.

482
00:26:14,839 --> 00:26:15,400
Come on.

483
00:26:15,799 --> 00:26:16,759
Soaked that long,

484
00:26:16,799 --> 00:26:18,359
anything useful is probably gone.

485
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:19,480
We still have DNA.

486
00:26:20,079 --> 00:26:21,359
Institute No.2 is on it too.

487
00:26:21,839 --> 00:26:23,759
They're prioritizing blood samples

488
00:26:23,759 --> 00:26:24,680
from nearby suspects.

489
00:26:25,359 --> 00:26:26,400
Isn't there any way

490
00:26:26,440 --> 00:26:28,559
to find this killer right now?

491
00:26:28,759 --> 00:26:29,799
I'm ready to do something,

492
00:26:29,799 --> 00:26:30,599
nowhere to use it.

493
00:26:30,599 --> 00:26:31,519
You get me, Tai Wei?

494
00:26:31,640 --> 00:26:33,000
Then put it to work here.

495
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:37,640
This list combines DMV data

496
00:26:38,440 --> 00:26:40,279
