501
00:26:50,440 --> 00:26:51,279
We're out of time.

502
00:26:51,839 --> 00:26:53,200
Can you do it in two days?

503
00:26:54,440 --> 00:26:55,039
Yes.

504
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:56,839
We'll get it done.

505
