510
00:27:15,359 --> 00:27:16,519
Don't get upset.

511
00:27:17,480 --> 00:27:19,079
It's okay. I'll handle it.

512
00:27:19,759 --> 00:27:20,480
Trust me.

513
00:27:21,720 --> 00:27:22,839
