514
00:27:23,759 --> 00:27:24,200
I...

515
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:26,279
Don't be. Don't be scared.

516
00:27:27,279 --> 00:27:28,359
Everything will be okay.

517
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:31,480
I have good news.

518
00:27:34,240 --> 00:27:35,480
We found Su Lin.

519
00:27:40,960 --> 00:27:41,720
Really?

520
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:45,559
Where is she now?

521
00:27:46,279 --> 00:27:47,319
Mr. Gu said

522
00:27:48,400 --> 00:27:49,680
