532
00:28:16,759 --> 00:28:18,400
Thanks, Mom.

533
00:28:19,960 --> 00:28:20,920
Don't worry.

534
00:28:26,599 --> 00:28:28,240
Mom, you haven't eaten, have you?

535
00:28:29,160 --> 00:28:30,559
I'll make you something.

